  "title": "CheckedHistory",
  "description": "Checks a registration's literal version bounds, adjacent migration inputs and outputs, and the final document type. Runtime history validates widened versions and migration arrays, and handles numeric comparisons between versions above 128 to avoid TypeScript's recursion limit.",
